WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
ProstateView Segmentation Lab: a guided educational contouring course.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Eight short modules connect image review, contouring and quality assurance.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000
The route moves from a primer to ten synthetic warm-ups, then thirty graded Prostate158 cases.

00:17.000 --> 00:25.000
Review the stack, commit your read, then trace the assigned boundary.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
Compare your contour with the educational reference and correct local errors.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
The case library contains three whole-gland, three zonal, twelve lesion, eight difficult-target and four verification exercises.

00:36.000 --> 00:39.000
The existing same-study GLB provides protected spatial context after scoring.

00:39.000 --> 00:42.000
Educational practice only: not a credential, diagnosis or procedure-planning tool.
